=== cw on a word acts like ce
ref:    change.txt *cw*
quote:  "Special case: When the cursor is in a word, \"cw\" and \"cW\" do not include the white space after a word"
given:  |foo bar
keys:   cwxy<Esc>
expect: x|y bar
mode:   normal
regs:   "" = "foo"   "1 = (unset)   "- = "foo"
undo:   |foo bar

=== cw stays in insert mode until <Esc>
ref:    change.txt *cw*
quote:  "they only change up to the end of the word"
given:  |foo bar
keys:   cwxy
expect: xy| bar
mode:   insert
